at? This is a real masterwork. Look at yourselves who are fighting with illusions, so poor.'),(367,'How\'s your feeling? Is it great to be tricked?'),(368,'No, please, please let me go!'),(369,'From now on, nothing is illusion.'),(370,'OK, follow me!'),(371,'I\'m tired of people who play double characters or things like just waiting for food.'),(372,'只有防守方的联盟才可以使用。'),(373,'同意退出联盟'),(374,'拒绝退出联盟'),(375,'同意退出联盟'),(376,'拒绝退出联盟'),(377,'굳젬촉직렴。'),(378,'行会被联盟。'),(379,'联盟已解散。');
